    "text": "ecsportslive.com\nwebsite\nWashington\nConnecticut Sun Snap Road Skid with 80–69 Win Over Mystics\n4 hours ago\nThe Connecticut Sun finally broke through their road woes on Tuesday night, defeating the Washington Mystics 80–69 at CareFirst Arena. The win ended a grueling 13-game road losing streak, marking the Sun’s first victory away from home since May 30 against Indiana. For a team that has endured...",
